# Frontend & Table Consumer UI

Stack: React + TypeScript, TailwindCSS, shadcn/ui, Lucide. Feature-based `src/components/` when adding app UI.

## Table engine (only grid implementation)

- Configure via four configs + props — **never** fork engine internals
- Required props in production UI: custom `loadingComponent`, `emptyComponent`, `errorComponent`
- State: `tableController` or `useTableEngine` — do not duplicate sort/filter/selection in Zustand
- Div-based grid only; engine sets ARIA roles — do not add conflicting `role="grid"` in overrides
- Column width/alignment via `ColumnDef` / `tableStyle` — not inline on cell divs

## UI quality

- Clarity over noise; WCAG AA contrast; visible focus rings
- CSS variables for theme colors — no hardcoded hex in components
- shadcn primitives in `components/ui/` — extend via wrappers, do not edit generated ui files
- Skeletons for loading; designed empty/error states; no raw error objects to users
- Lucide only; icon-only controls need `aria-label` + Tooltip

## Avoid

Purple-gradient defaults, glassmorphism without purpose, `any`, spinners for content areas, hiding focus outlines, shadcn `Table` for data grids.

